sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant R as github-terraform-runner
    participant T as terraform-runner-template
    participant F as github-terraform-framework
    participant S as AWS S3
    participant G as GitHub API

    Note over R: Push to main triggers terraform-deploy.yaml

    R->>T: call reusable-terraform-deploy.yaml@SHA
    T->>F: checkout framework at framework_ref SHA
    F-->>T: Terraform module checked out

    T->>S: download private repo YAML files<br/>(vars.PRIVATE_REPOS_FILES via private_repos_prefix)
    S-->>T: Personal.yml, Resume.yml, github-sandbox.yml

    Note over T: Overlay: runner inventory merged into framework workspace
    T->>T: overlay terraform/public/ => terraform/repos/public/<br/>overlay tests/fixtures/terraform/private/ => terraform/repos/private/

    T->>T: terraform init (S3 backend)
    T->>T: terraform plan

    Note over T: Apply only on main push (not PR)
    T->>G: terraform apply<br/>(github_repository, rulesets, CODEOWNERS)
    G-->>T: resources reconciled

    T-->>R: deploy complete
